Subject: Count <use> hops against MAX_RENDER_DEPTH

render_children() caps lexical nesting at MAX_RENDER_DEPTH (256), but
render_use() calls render_element() on its target directly, so a chain of
distinct <use> elements (a -> b -> c -> ...) recurses on the C stack to the
chain's length and a document of about a megabyte overflows it.
has_cycle_reference() stops only a <use> already on the render stack.

Count each <use> hop in the same context->depth, and stop at the same cap.
Moves the MAX_RENDER_DEPTH definition above its first use.

zusvg: .agents/design.md §9, §17 D4. Offered upstream.

